# held/props/hoe: the field hoe for the Hoe posture (PROPS, P2b): a long pale ash haft through both hands, an iron blade;
# raised over the right shoulder (high: the blade up behind) and chopped into the soil before the feet (low). Format:
# rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Around the pose arms' grips, anchored on the right shoulder; under the fists.
